toyota-motor-corporation-tm-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"TM 2021 Q3","e":"tm","d":"2021-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenta Kon","x":"While carefully monitoring the risks, we will continue to make efforts together with all our stakeholders, including cost reduction efforts at all levels and efforts at manufacturing sites and sales outlets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/toyota-motor-corporation-tm-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"TM 2021 Q4","e":"tm","d":"2021-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenta Kon","x":"Second, cost reduction efforts increased operating income by JPY150 billion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/13/toyota-motor-corporation-tm-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"TM 2021 Q4","e":"tm","d":"2021-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenta Kon","x":"On the other hand, in North America and Asia, operating income increased year-on-year, thanks mainly to marketing efforts and cost reduction efforts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/13/toyota-motor-corporation-tm-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"TM 2027 Q2","e":"tm","d":"2026-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Takanori Azuma","x":"In addition, to reduce tariff-related costs through the accumulation of improvement efforts, including the expansion of value chain earnings, we expect year-on-year profit growth and have revised our forecast upward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/toyota-motor-tm-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TM 2027 Q2","e":"tm","d":"2026-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Takanori Azuma","x":"In addition, we captured positive effects from changes in the operating environment, including the effects of foreign exchange rates and the mitigation of the impact of U.S. tariffs, resulting in a year-on-year increase in operating income.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/toyota-motor-tm-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TM 2027 Q2","e":"tm","d":"2026-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Yoichi Miyazaki","x":"As Kurama-san, you have rightly pointed out, the China market, the internal, the domestic demand, and the gas price hikes had been impacting the market, and the market has been downsizing year-on-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/toyota-motor-tm-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TM 2027 Q2","e":"tm","d":"2026-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Takanori Azuma","x":"On the other hand, including similar in Japan and U.S., the material price hikes in the market has been affecting us like a body blow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/toyota-motor-tm-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TM 2027 Q2","e":"tm","d":"2026-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kazu Hashimoto","x":"To introduce you the schedule, we will receive the explanation about the second quarter financial results from Mr. Azuma, and then Mr. Miyazaki will explain about the progress of our structural reform activities, restructuring activities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/toyota-motor-tm-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TM 2027 Q2","e":"tm","d":"2026-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Yoichi Miyazaki","x":"Moving forward, we will return to a strong growth trajectory by increasing production of high-demand hybrid batteries, significantly reducing external outflow costs by restructuring our vehicle lineup, and advancing automation through the introduction of robotics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/toyota-motor-tm-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[43,1,14984,0,0,0,11782,1697],[44,1,6555,0,0,0,5261,835],[45,1,12956,0,0,0,11025,789],[67,1,13738,0,0,0,13603,0]],"cinema":[[43,1,14984,0,0,0,11782,1697],[44,1,6555,0,0,0,5261,835],[45,1,12956,0,0,0,11025,789